<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Selfcare started -analyst.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Selfcare started -analyst.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Richard B. Silver said he initiated coverage of Selfcare Inc with an outperform rating, citing his expectations for the company to achieve profitability in the second half of 1997 and rapidly accelerating earnings growth in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 5/8 at 15-1/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
